  "history": "The green shahada banner of the Wahhabi movement, to which Ibn Saud added the sword in 1921 when he took the title Sultan of Nejd. The sultanate absorbed Jabal Shammar in 1921 and Hejaz in 1925 and became the Kingdom of Hejaz and Nejd in 1926; the flag is the direct ancestor of the present Saudi flag, standardised in 1973.",
